<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:54 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Hebrews</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Hê-bơ-rơ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hê-bơ-rơ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Heb</para>
  <para style="mt">Hê-bơ-rơ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Đom 'ngưng kawat ji bơơn 'ngưng kach xing tuôôy hnu, atêq tuôôy Kơy Plêêk xanoh dii khơl mo kơy bơyh khơl hnhư hlit, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />yôôych muut kaluh hngơy lôôch dik neq, Kadraq heq xanoh dii haay bơyh Koot Kadraq, laa Kơy đơu Kadraq heq lâp dơơp Dro Dưk Katôôl tôôy paroh, kung gamưh hlê Koot nưq, Kadraq heq panưk jêêk kaluh đơơy xanưm; <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />đơu Koot nưq laa varơuq tađnah xaraar tađnah tađnaak ji varơuq long lơuq jơq dik truh katik ku Kadraq, katuôôy tơơk đơ tôôy paroh xing apok taay yaak ku Kadraq, yôôch tuôôy heq dưk dơơp varơuq paxa rêh kadrôôp maroh, Koot nưq 'ngôôy pi akoh Kơy Ra uk Ra aal tol aduq yơơt; <verse eid="HEB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />jo jah jêêk vlôh yơơt galơh iaq khơl yaak plêêk, Koot heq jah nhonq yal kơn kôt dalơh gôp 'ngưng yưk iaq khơl yaak plêêk nưq. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Vii Kadraq e hmưq xanoh dii kơy leq đom khơl kơy yaak đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Koot laa Koot ku Gô.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">Hngơy neng Gô heq pahleh Koot”?</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Laay kung xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Gô hnoq laa Vaq đôôyq dii Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">ji Kadraq hnoq laa Koot deng ka Gô”?<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Bơh măn iaq đnoyq, tuôôy Kadraq taway Koot Muuyq muut dêh araak, Kadraq xanoh: “Dêq hloay khơl yaak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk pheq ayuôôt laat Koot nưq.” <verse eid="HEB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Đôôyq dii khơl yaak plêêk, Kadraq xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Kơy khienq khơl kơy yaak kadraq jêêk đaji khiel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">ji khơl xapok Kadraq jêêk kaluh gooy ôôlh.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Măn đôôyq dii Koot nưq, yôôych:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Kuh Kơy Plêêk, ngaai Kadraq măn truh đơơy đơơy miet miet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">ji gay katôôl hyioh jăk laa gay katôôl ku daak plêêk Kadraq.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Kadraq xiaq varơuq hyioh jăk ji 'yarơ varơuq xơk tauq.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Vii kơq nưq, Kơy Plêêk, 'ngưq laa Kơy Plêêk ku Kadraq, heq para ka Kadraq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">jơu hlah hlaak galơh iaq khơl 'wơyq Kadraq.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Ji “Kuh Lôôk, tuôôy kapa tep, Kadraq panưk kahnier play vari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">ji kaluh tal plêêk laa kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ti Kadraq.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Kaluh nưq hnoq hư hlơơp, bơh Kadraq hloay măn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">dêq hloay kaluh nưq hnoq duut moor đaji poop aau yơơt,<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />ji đaji poop aau kahliik, Kadraq hnoq ahnom kaluh nưq hlê,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">đaji aau gôk, kaluh nưq hnoq biq leh vlôh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">bơh Kadraq yôôych măn i ja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">ji kaluh xanưm ku Kadraq hnoq leh hmưq dêq.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nưq bơh, Kadraq e hmưq đnooy dii kơy leq đom khơl kơy yaak:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“Dayh 'ngôôy pi akoh Gô</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">dong truh tuôôy leq Gô khienq khơl adro tachơơl ku Koot jêêk đool đơ ka jôôk Koot”?<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Be aalq dêq hloay khơl kơy nưq laa kaluh yaak hơu varơuq, jah patăk ka varơuq 'yo jư vii lơơy ich ku khơl dro jeq nhonq varơuq wơơt xok long aleq?<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Vii kơq nưq, varơuq neq băt haay pheq văch 'yo kơn iaq đnoyq truh kaluh kajoq heq hmưq jah tameng, tebe xăk xamơk đôôk klơlh kaluh nưq. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Vii atoh apok Lôôk heq jah padoh taboon gamưh khơl yaak plêêk heq jêêk vlôh varơuq kajưk dik, ji tôôy lôp kadrôôp kung varơuq leh tameng heq nhonq xok hmơt dook taxưngq, <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />yôôych dơơp aleq haay hnoq xaloot ik tuôôy heq 'yo leh ra kajoq varơuq wơơt xok kôt đanưq? Đơu varơuq wơơt xok nưq, atêq tuôôy xarôp gamưh Lôôk jah pahêêr đnooy adroyq dik, yôôych jah 'yo nhonq ka haay xing khơl dro heq tameng; <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />vii Kơy Plêêk kung anguk achung dơơp xanưk dii oot bơơn kaluh hlêêl akêh, pheep akêh, ji 'ngưng varơuq taay yaak đêh mamuuyq, kung varơuq kahniq ăm ku Lôôk Phool Hiel tyauq xuum trôôch Kadraq.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Vii be aalq deng ka khơl yaak plêêk đơu Kơy Plêêk rôp băt dêh araak jeq truh, laa dêh araak đơu haay đong đnooy truh. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Mot kadrơy, e manih heq dơơp xanưk măn ka'leq nưq, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Koot manih laa kajoq, đơu Kadraq tabông truh ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">long koot ku koot manih laa kajoq, đơu Kadraq 'yo jư ni?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Kadraq khienq manih 'laarq iaq taso dii khơl yaak plêêk đom muuyq kawat lêq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">Kadraq ayil đoat tađnah ka manih đom varơuq tađnah tađnaak ji jah vado.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq athêêp: </char><char style="fqa">ji Kadraq heq xôq oot 'yo jư kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ti Kadraq.</char> </note><verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Kadraq xôq tôôy paroh 'laarq jôôk manih.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Vii đom tuôôy rôp băt tôôy paroh, Kadraq xôq be muuyq paroh kajoq leh tameng tyauq manih. Bơh juneq haay măn kalưp hloq tôôy paroh tameng tyauq manih, <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />bơh haay hloq Lôôk Jê-xu, laa Kơy jah khienq ăm 'laarq iaq khơl yaak plêêk đom muuyq kawat lêq, heq jah ayil đoat tađnah đom varơuq tađnah tađnaak ji jah vado vii kơq varơuq pơơl hwơơl aduq varơuq kaxêêt ku Kadraq, xôq bơyh vanong plêêk Kơy Plêêk, Kadraq hnoq ik chiuq kaxêêt thay ka tôôy dro. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Vii Kơy Plêêk, Kơy đơu vii Kadraq tôôy paroh heq e ji gamưh Kadraq tôôy paroh heq e, xôq jarooy 'ngưng koot truh varơuq tađnah tađnaak, yôôych heq dưk dơơp kach thier jơq tuôôy khienq Kơy Dơơp Akoq varơuq wơơt xok ku oot vlôh xaleep gamưh varơuq pơơl hwơơl. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Vii kaah Kơy vah xarêh kung dêq hloay khơl dro jah vah xarêh vlôh xing muuyq gooy. Vii kơq neq, Kadraq leh kamưưl xôq taayh oot laa oh ay, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />tuôôy xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“Koot hnoq đnooy vlôh yal Kadraq ka khơl oh ay ku Koot;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">Koot hnoq kacheeu ayuôôt Kadraq măn katul manih karôp.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Ji muuyq yưk tra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“Gô hnoq tuôq gamưh aduq Kơy Plêêk.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Yôôch laay đnoyq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“'Yo nee, gô ji khơl koot de đơu Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka gô.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Anưq yôôch, vii khơl koot de e phon đom vahaap hlek, lunưq Kadraq kung e phon đom kung kaluh varơuq nưq dang đanưq xôq gamưh varơuq kaxêêt kadraq, Kadraq hnoq ik păk kaxêêt adro adrơk qwuyen varơuq kaxêêt, 'ngưq laa kamuuych, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />ji hnoq ik wơơt xaloot khơl dro nưq, 'ngưq laa paq kê kơyq riirh dêq hloay vii kamo yôq varơuq kaxêêt, laa varơuq dơơp xapok tuôôt đơơy. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Vii dong dik, leh aalq kadraq 'yo jư khơl yaak plêêk, wih hlê Kadraq jư 'yo adrơơk ku Ap-ra-ham, <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />kơq nưq Kadraq duh pheq jah khienq jêêk dang oh ay kadraq đom tôôy panưh, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik jêêk vlôh thơy tơơk tưp kôt ragơy biit angơuq ji jư apok đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq wih xuq Kơy Plêêk dii iq đinq kahnoq vlôh vanong plêêk tol kadrôôp maroh ku tamooy Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Atêq tuôôy chiuq adô aluut, Kadraq hnoq ik wơơt waak khơl leq biq adô aluut, vii jơq Kadraq heq hmưq tavơh tuôôt varơuq nưq.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay hlăng vah, laa khơl dro jưq phon đom varơuq tawooyh taayh xing plêêk, dayh 'yo tabông muut Kơy Jah Patăk ji Thơy Tơơk Tưp Kôt ku apok đnooy xưng haay, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />tuôôy muuyq xuum dii Kơy heq pato đinq Kadraq, kung dang đaji Môi-se đom hnhư Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Vii Kơy neq jah 'yo nhonq laa taxưngq dii tađnah tađnaak kôt galơh iaq Môi-se, kung đaji manih xơy hnhư jah vado 'ngưng iaq xet taleq so dii poop hnhư. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Vii tôôy poop hnhư yôôych jah xơy panưk xing muuyq akơyq nưq, bơh Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy panưk jêêk tôôy paroh. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Môi-se yôôych muuyq xuum đaji muuyq dro xapok đom kaah hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk, xôq đaji muuyq apok xanưk ku kaluh varơuq hnoq jah đnooy truh đom atêq neq; <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Bơh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đaji muuyq Adro Koot đôôyq dii hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk (haay laa hnhư ku Kadraq atoh haay jư kajưk xuum tuôq dik ji kơq pa ưưt vlôh truh varơuq takôô gamưh ku haay). <verse eid="HEB 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Kơq nưq, jơq đaji Lôôk Phool Hiel xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Hngơy neng, atoh khơl koot tameng apok Kadraq,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />yôôych te dơơp găk xuum khơl koot</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">đaji đom varơuq dơơp paloanq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">đom tuôôt kawat thưh thek aduq wăngq we<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />laa aduq mo kơy khơl koot heq thưh Gô gamưh varơuq thek dơơp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">yôôch oot heq 'yo hloq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku Gô<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />tuôôt poot kưl xanưm. Vii anưq, Gô thier jaraq dii adrơơk nưq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">ji Gô xanoh: ‘Oot kưq hloay biq jarooy patuut hyaak hyul aduq xuum oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">đơu oot heq be nhonq xet kaluh trôôk hooy ku Gô.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Đaji Gô heq paleek đom đơơt tôq jaraq ku Gô:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘… Oot hnoq leh muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Gô!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Wơơy oh ay, dayh rơơt rol, tebe xuum klaak leh tuôq xơk tauq hnoq xalih vlôh aduq muuyq kơyq nưq đom khơl oh ay, 'ngưq laa aduq adro vlôh xangưưy klơlh Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Lunư, dayh ahmưk nhăk hloay mamuuyq tôôy muuyq hngơy, dong truh tuôôy leq măn đong jah taayh laa “hngơy neng,” xôq leh akơyq đom katul oh ay biq dơơp ka găk khăk xing varơuq aluut pa ôôh ku kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Vii haay heq jêêk vlôh khơl manih jưq phon ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, vơ duh laa haay jư kajưk kapa tep xuum tuôq dong dik ku haay dong truh lôôch dik, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />đaji varơuq jah đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Hngơy neng, atoh khơl koot tameng apok Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">te dơơp găk xuum khơl koot</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">đaji đom varơuq paloanq.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Vii khơl adro leq tache jaraq Kadraq atêq tuôôy heq tameng? Leh akơyq đêh vlôh dêq hloay khơl manih heq vlôh klơlh Ai Kâp gamưh Môi-se ih? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Măn Kadraq heq thier jaraq dii khơl adro tuôôt poot kưl xanưm? Dik be aalq laa dii khơl adro lôp kadrôôp, đơu xaak ku oot heq gưlh riêp đom wăngq we ih? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Yôôch Kadraq heq paleek kung khơl adro leq hnoq leh jah muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Kadraq, atoh be aalq kung khơl adro leh tameng tyauq? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Haay hloq đaneq oot heq leh e paraat xôq tawaak muut vii kơq xuum leh tuôq.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Jo nưq, haay duh xet vadrau yôq, e đaneq đong tuôôy apok tavek tawaak muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Kadraq măn e đnư, yôôych akơyq nưq đom oh ay dang đaji heq tavlaayh hlơơp. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Vii dang dii oot, haay kung heq jah padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay. Lunư, varơuq tameng apok Lôôk nưq heq be e ich lơơy kajoq ka oot, tuôôy leh jah takhiit dii xuum tuôq măn đom khơl adro tameng.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaluh rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">Bơh apok kơy plêêk nưq wih be e lơơy kajoq ka khơl adro tameng đơu be tajinq muut xuum tuôq muut ni.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Đôôyq dii haay, laa khơl manih heq tuôq, yôôych jah muut đom varơuq padơy pado, tyauq kach đơu Kadraq heq xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Đaji Gô heq paleek đom đơơt tôq jaraq ku Gô,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘… oot hnoq leh hmưq e 'leq jah muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Gô!’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">long tabơh kaluh varơuq dơơp Kadraq heq payôôch xing tuôôy dơơp kahnier dêh araak. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Vii e aduq Kadraq heq xanoh đaji luneq truh hngơy thưq pơh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:4">“Ji Kơy Plêêk padơy tôôy varơuq dơơp Kadraq muut hngơy thưq pơh.”<verse eid="HEB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Ji yưk tra đom muuyq aduq kadrơy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:5">“… Oot hnoq leh dong leq jah muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Gô.”<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Đanưq, tuôôy apok tavek măn e deng ka muuyq sôôq manih xôq muut đom varơuq padơy pado nưq, đơu khơl adro adroyq neq hmưq jah padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay heq leh muut ik vii varơuq leh tameng tyauq, <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />yôôych Kơy Plêêk laay đinq vlôh muuyq hngơy heq đinq, taayh laa “Hngơy neng,” tuôôy xanoh bơyh Đa-vik atêq kaplah kawat thier xiik, đaji apok heq jah đnooy truh aduq taalh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Hngơy neng, atoh khơl koot tameng apok Kadraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">yôôych te dơơp găk xuum khơl koot.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Vii atoh Jô-suê heq taway truh varơuq padơy pado ka manih karôp, yôôych kajưk dik Kadraq heq leh đnooy truh muuyq hngơy kadrơy atêq kaluh varơuq neq. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Vii anưq, măn e đnư varơuq padơy pado Sa-bat deng ka manih karôp ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Vii dro leq heq muut đom varơuq padơy pado ku Kadraq, jơq dro nưq kung padơy kaluh varơuq dơơp ni, dang đaji Kơy Plêêk đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq dơơp ku Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Đanưq, haay duh talăng jăk muut đom varơuq padơy pado nưq, xôq leh akơyq gưlh muut kung đaji varơuq ku varơuq leh tameng hơq. <verse eid="HEB 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Vii apok Kơy Plêêk laa riirh, jêêk hlit ji xưr mưr iaq kaluh pla xieh vaarq pla, tăp hlal dong truh aduq aklah vlôh phool dii hiel, kaah atu hloay glo, ji hnoq ik 'yo hloq kaluh xuum biit kung iq đinq ku xuum klaak. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Be tôôy paroh leq laa kadook padu kangưưr Kadraq. Wih hlê, tôôy paroh klăng klôlh ji heq biq kahnoq vlôh kangưưr ku Kadraq, laa Kơy đơu apok padoh vlôh ku haay wih truh.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Đanưq, đong tuôôy e muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt galơh heq dalơh hlê kaluh tal plêêk, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu Koot Kơy Plêêk, yôôych haay duh jư kajưk apok xưng vlôh ku haay. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Vii leh aalq haay e muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt be hnoq ik biit angơuq dii kaluh ravoch ku haay, wih hlê laa Kơy heq chiuq adô aluut đom tôôy panưh tyauq kach dang đaji haay, đơu be e kadrôôp maroh kajoq. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Nưq yôôych, dii xuum kôk kalh, haay hnoq ik truh jeq ngôôy vanong plêêk, xôq nhonq xok varơuq biit angơuq ji axek jah vanong kaxay đom varơuq waak klip kawat.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Vii tôôy dro thơy tơơk tưp kôt, tuôôy jah rơơlh vlôh xing katul manih karôp, jah pato đinq dưk thay ka manih karôp đom kaluh varơuq dơơp apiq truh Kơy Plêêk, xôq hnoq ik tơơk tưp kuah lêh ji ôq lêh bla kadrôôp; <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />tuôôy e paraat biit angơuq dii khơl adro vlô khưrq ji hyaak hyul, vii jơq kơy kung biq varơuq ravoch rôp dăt. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Vii kơq nưq, manih nưq pheq tơơk tưp ôq lêh bla kadrôôp, đaji ka manih karôp đaleq, yôôych kung ka kadih xăk đanưq. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Leh muuyq akơyq nhonq xok vanê tơơk neq ka ni, đơu vơ jah Kơy Plêêk tawooyh taayh, kung dang đaji A-rôn. <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Dang anưq, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kung heq leh kadih vanê kadraq tok dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt. Tađôôy muut đnư laa Kơy heq đnooy dii Kadraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“Koot laa Koot Gô;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">hngơy neng Gô heq pahleh vlôh Koot.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Đaji Kơy nưq kung e xanoh măn muuyq aduq kadrơy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Koot laa thơy tơơk tưp dong truh đơơy đơơy,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">tyauq adrơơk Mên-chi-xê-đeek.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Tuôôt kaluh hngơy măn đom xăk xamơk kadraq, Kadraq heq tơơk tưp kaah apok apôôy hloay apôôy vôôch, kung dii apok taayh nhim alo dêq xuum ji daak mot atok ka Kơy e taay yaak wơơt kadraq klơlh kaxêêt, ji Kadraq heq jah tameng vii đơơy riirh tuôq kul ku kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Ju laa Koot, bơh Kadraq heq hok xet varơuq tameng tyauq xing kaluh varơuq đơu Kadraq chiuq uunq. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Ji tuôôy heq jah jêêk xaleep, Kadraq jêêk vlôh gooy wơơt xok đơơy đơơy ka dêq hloay khơl leq tameng tyauq Kadraq, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />atêq tuôôy jah Kơy Plêêk pato đinq dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt tyauq adrơơk Mên-chi-xê-đeek, <verse eid="HEB 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />đơu truh manih neq yôôych varơuq xung đnooy ka haay laa thier 'ngưng, ji leh klêq padoh hlolh, vii kơq oh ay heq jêêk vlôh alah đom varơuq tameng. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Vii pheq đnooy truh tuôôy neq, đangq leq heq laa khơl dro thơy, oh ay laay e duh axek akơyq nưq pato dayq oh ay kaluh tanưưl duh dik đom kaluh apok ku Kơy Plêêk, ji oh ay heq jêêk khơl adro e duh truh sưah, bơh leh aalq tuôông xa găk! <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Bơyh vii paq kê akơyq vơ hôôch sưah yôôych thiuq hlolh xet truh kaluh apok ku varơuq hyioh jăk, vii manih nưq măn ja laa on oh de. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Bơh tuôông xa găk laa deng ka khơl dro heq kôt, 'ngưq laa khơl leq gamưh e katik ragơy dưk dơơp e paraat nhonq xet dii muuyq varơuq kahra vlôh kaah varơuq kaxay hloay varơuq xơk.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Vii anưq, tuôôy heq ka'lăk pi atêq apok đaauq duh dik truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, haay duh pheq tawaak truh varơuq kôt xet, leh lâp hlê varơuq kahnier truh varơuq rawiit xuum chuh klơlh kaluh varơuq dơơp kaxêêt, truh xuum tuôq aduq Kơy plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />pato dayq truh pheep bap-tem, kaah varơuq xôq ti hloay varơuq riirh hlê ku adro kaxêêt, ji varơuq xưh xadrah đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Haay hnoq dơơp varơuq nưq atoh Kơy Plêêk ăm pheep. <verse eid="HEB 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Vii nưq laa varơuq leh dơơp ik — đôôyq dii khơl adro heq hmưq jah luh tađnah, kung dii hmưq nhonq vanong kaxay xing plêêk, jêêk vlôh dro jưq phon đom Lôôk Phool Hiel <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />ji nhemq xet apok tolh kaxay ku Kơy Plêêk kung kaluh taay yaak ku đơơy xanưm jeq truh <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />đơu gưlh lôp — xôq laay 'meq hlê khơl adro nưq wih truh varơuq wiit xuum, tuôôy đongq đing Koot Kơy Plêêk ka oot muuyq yưk tra, ji ăm hloq dơơp kamưưl Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Vii muuyq wơơng vari, tuôôy heq 'nharum voq daak jit 'ngưng yưk jit pôôt tol ni ji vlok vlôh raak play tolh kaxay ka khơl kadrơy, 'ngưq laa ăm khơl leq dơơp pêêt ni, yôôych e phon đom vanong kaxay xing Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Măn tuôôy vlok gay jaliê ji rek, yôôych wơơng vari nưq laa thưq vih ka'lăk ji jeq đaji muuyq varơuq karoay axaap, đơu aduq lôôch dik ku ni laa deng ka ôôlh vuh jaq.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Bơh truh oh ay, khơl dro jah xung xiaq, hloay kaah tuôôy đnooy đanưq, 'wot heq jah tuôq kajưk truh kaluh varơuq kaxay tamaq iaq ji ham tađnưk vanong wơơt xok. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Vii Kơy Plêêk leh aalq laa leh hyioh jăk xôq yôôch tawol varơuq dơơp ku oh ay, kung xuum xung xiaq đơu oh ay heq kahnoq vlôh ka yal Kadraq, tuôôy hmưq hơu varơuq khơl vah ji juneq kung măn hơu varơuq oot. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Bơh 'Wot thier trôôch tôôy dro đom oh ay kahnoq vlôh xuum talăng jăk đanưq, wih truh varơuq tuôq kajưk dêq hloay truh xuum takôô gamưh ku oh ay dong truh lôôch dik, <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />xôq ka oh ay leh jêêk vlôh khơl adro alah, bơh laa khơl dro dơơp tyauq kaluh ramil gamưh xuum tuôq ji xuum atuq đơu nhonq jah apok tavek.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Vii Kơy Plêêk, tuôôy tavek dii Ap-ra-ham, bơyh kơq Kadraq be e kơyq kôt iaq xôq gamưh muut đơu paleek, yôôych heq paleek gamưh muut kadih Kadraq, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />đaneq: “Vii kajưk dik laa atoh kahniq vanong, Gô hnoq uk vanong pôôt tol koot, ji atoh ja athêêp, Gô hnoq khienq koot athêêp 'ngưng tok.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Jo nưq, atêq tuôôy xuum atuq takôô, kơy heq nhonq jah apok tavek nưq. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Vii khơl kadrơy paleek bơơn kach gamưh muut muuyq akơyq nưq kôt iaq oot, ji đôôyq dii oot, aduq payôôch tôôy varơuq tagoa jarooy truh aduq 'yo nhonq jơq laa apok paleek, <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />vii kach nưq, tuôôy xung kahnoq vlôh kach raah jôh iaq đnoyq ka khơl dro dưk katôôl apok tavek truh varơuq leh tađôôy ku iq đinq Kadraq, yôôych Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp xanưk muut bơơn muuyq apok paleek <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />xôq ka gamưh vaarq varơuq be tađôôy nưq, truh vaarq varơuq nưq leh kach leq xôq Kơy Plêêk đnooy pa ôôh, haay, laa khơl dro charơơk truh aduq du moq, hnoq ik e jah varơuq ahmưk nhăk kalh paraat xôq jư kajưk xok xuum takôô gamưh đong xôq kangưưr haay; <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />'ngưq laa xuum takôô gamưh đơu haay jah xok đaji muuyq poop neeo ka phool hiel, vơơ hrok hrol vơơ kajưk dik, ji hooy muut pi 'lăp bơk maang, <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />aduq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq hooy muut đaji muuyq Kơy hooy adroyq thay ka haay, atêq tuôôy jêêk vlôh thơy tơơk tưp kôt dong truh đơơy đơơy tyauq adrơơk Mên-chi-xê-đeek.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Vii Mên-chi-xê-đeek neq, 'ngưq laa vuua ku Sa-lem, thơy tơơk tưp ku Kơy Plêêk Thier Yơơt, manih heq tavơh Ap-ra-ham đong tuôôy wiit xuq xing đơơt tahmơt hrưp khơl vuua, ji heq chuk vanong ka kơy, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />đơu Ap-ra-ham kung heq aklah vlôh đêh muuyq phon kưl xing dêq hloay garuh anôôp hmơt jăk deng ka vuua nưq; adroyq dik, Mên-chi-xê-đeek jah jich laa “vuua hyioh jăk,” đơu đêh vlôh kung laa vuua ku Sa-lem, iq laa “vuua hrok hrol,” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />vuua leh e vaq, leh e miq, leh e katôôl, kung leh e kaluh hngơy paxa rôp long lôôch dik đơơy riirh, bơh jah jêêk dang đaji Koot Kơy Plêêk, vuua măn kưq laa thơy tơơk tưp dong truh miet miet.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Bơh dayh tabông 'yo vuua nưq kôt galơh đaleq, đơu mo kơy Ap-ra-ham heq tơơk tưp phon kưl xing đom kaluh garuh anôôp tahmơt jăk tolh dik. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Măn khơl dro xing adrơơk Lê-vi, tuôôy dưk dơơp chưk tơơk tưp, yôôych e apok tanưưl xôq xok hlê muuyq phon kưl xing manih karôp tyauq ganuun, iq laa xing oh ay haay, ju raay heq vlôh xing xuum Ap-ra-ham. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Lunư, tuôôy leh jah 'yo đom adrơơk vlôh xing oot, vuua neq heq thu xok phon kưl aduq Ap-ra-ham, ji heq chuk vanong ka manih e kaluh apok tavek. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Panưh kadrơy, be e paq kê varơuq tayaat leq tuôôy manih băk 'laarq iaq jah chuk vanong xing manih băk yơơt iaq. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Ji đom ka varơuq neq, khơl manih đong jeq kaxêêt nhonq xok phon kưl, măn đom ka varơuq hơq, vuua nưq jah 'yo xanưk laa măn đong riirh. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Hnoq ik đnooy muuyq varơuq luneq, Lê-vi, manih thu kaluh phon kưl, kung heq jah thu phon kưl gamưh hlê Ap-ra-ham, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />vii kơy đong măn đom klaak ku mo kơy ku kơy tuôôy Mên-chi-xê-đeek tavơh mot Ap-ra-ham.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Anưq, atoh varơuq xaleep laa gamưh chưk tơơk tưp ku manih Lê-vi (vii tol varơuq nưq, manih karôp heq jah kahniq ăm ganuun), yôôych duh kajoq pheq panưk tok athêêp thơy tơơk tưp kadrơy tyauq adrơơk Mên-chi-xê-đeek, đơu leh jah 'yo tyauq adrơơk A-rôn? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Vii tuôôy chưk tơơk tưp biq tađôôy, yôôych jo varơuq rôp băt, varơuq tađôôy truh ganuun kung pheq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Vii Kadraq, Kơy đơu kaluh varơuq neq đong jah đnooy truh, thuôk muuyq adrơơk kadrơy, đơu xing đom adrơơk nưq koq e kơyq hmưq hơu varơuq aduq para hơu. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Vii ro raang đaneq Lôôk haay pa iir vlôh xing Ju-đa, đơu đôôyq dii adrơơk nưq, Môi-se heq be đnooy varơuq kajoq tajinq truh khơl thơy tơơk tưp. <verse eid="HEB 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Varơuq neq pheq đnooy kơn ro raang iaq đnoyq atoh muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kadrơy dưk tok tyauq long lơuq ku Mên-chi-xê-đeek, <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />laa Kơy jêêk vlôh thơy tơơk tưp leh tyauq ganuun đom ganeen ku xăk xamơk, bơh laa tyauq taay yaak ku varơuq riirh paq kaxêêt. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Vii Kadraq jah dơơp xanưk đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">“Koot laa thơy tơơk tưp đơơy đơơy tyauq adrơơk Mên-chi-xê-đeek.”<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Vii muuyq panưh, varơuq ka'lăk ganeen adroyq neq xalih vlôh vii ni ravoch ji leh xung liq <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />(nưq jo ganuun be dơơp ăm xaleep varơuq kajoq), ji panưh kadrơy laa varơuq xagook hlê xuum takôô gamưh kaxay tamaq iaq, đơu gamưh đnư haay truh jeq Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Ji be aalq jah dêq hloay kaluh varơuq nưq đơu leh e apok paleek, — vii long khơl manih hơq be e apok paleek yôôych heq jêêk vlôh khơl thơy tơơk tưp, <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />bơh Kadraq yôôych apiq tajinq dii muuyq apok paleek, gamưh Kơy xanoh dii Kadraq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Lôôk heq paleek ji hnoq leh tađôôy iq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Koot laa thơy tơơk tưp dong truh đơơy đơơy.’” —<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />vii anưq tyauq kach thier galơh nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu heq jêêk vlôh Kơy hôôk kajưk ku muuyq tavek tolh iaq. <verse eid="HEB 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ji long khơl manih hmưq jêêk vlôh thơy tơơk tưp laa karôp iaq, vii kơq biq varơuq kaxêêt klơl hlê xôq kưq dơơp đnoyq, <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />anưq bơh, Kadraq jư chưk tơơk tưp leh ik tađôôy, vii Kadraq hloay măn dong truh đơơy đơơy, <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />đơu vii kơq nưq, Kadraq kung e taay yaak xôq wơơt xok truh mưk xaleep khơl adro truh jeq Kơy Plêêk gamưh Kadraq, laa Kơy hloay riirh xôq apôôy vôôch thay ka oot. <verse eid="HEB 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Vii muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt đanưq dik jơq laa deng ka haay: Kơy hlăng vah, be e kadrôôp, paxa rêh, jah aklah vlôh klơlh khơl adro kadrôôp maroh, ji jêêk vlôh yơơt galơh iaq kakuh tal plêêk; <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />laa Kơy leh e varơuq duh tôôy hngơy dang đaji khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kadrơy, pheq tơơk tưp ôq lêh, adroyq dik laa thay ka kadrôôp ku kadih oot, atêq nưq laa kadrôôp ku manih karôp, vii Kadraq heq dơơp payôôch varơuq nưq atêq tuôôy pahnăp tơơk tưp kadih kadraq muuyq yưk đu hloay. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Vii ganuun panưk tok khơl koot manih e varơuq pơh pơơl dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt, bơh apok paleek, laa varơuq truh atêq ganuun, yôôych pato đinq Koot, laa Kơy heq jah dơơp jêêk xaleep dong truh đơơy đơơy.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Nưq yôôych, aduq duh dik truh varơuq đong jah đnooy padoh laa đaneq: Haay e muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt đanưq, laa Kơy heq 'ngôôy măn pi akoh ngaai ku Kơy Ra uk Ra aal tol kaluh tal plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />muuyq xapok ku aduq vah ji raap đơ dong dik đơu jơq Lôôk heq panưk tok, leh aalq koot manih. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Vii tôôy muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt yôôych jah pato đinq xôq tưp kaah kaluh kuah lêh hloay kaluh ôq lêh, đơu vii kơq nưq, Kơy nưq kung duh e varơuq kajoq nưq đơu Kadraq hnoq ik tơơk tưp tok. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Anưq, atoh đaji Kadraq đong măn tol vari, yôôych kajưk dik Kadraq pheq đnooy heq leh dơơp thơy tơơk tưp, vii heq e khơl dro tơơk tưp kuah lêh tyauq ganuun; <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />laa khơl dro hơu varơuq muuyq kahri dơơp tyauq ji long lơuq ku kaluh varơuq tol plêêk, đaji Môi-se hmưq jah đnooy dăt tuôôy jeq dơơp payôôch raap đơ, vii Kơy Plêêk xanoh: “Dayh rơơt rol, koot hnoq pheq dơơp tôôy thưq tyauq khwuôôn anưq heq jah kahnoq ka koot tol đoot.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Bơh juneq Kadraq heq nhonq xok muuyq varơuq dơơp kôt galơh iaq taleq, Kadraq kung laa Kơy Kaplah ku muuyq tavek tolh iaq tanư, laa tavek heq jah lâp tok gamưh tol kaluh apok tavek tolh iaq. <verse eid="HEB 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Vii atoh tavek thưq nhưk nưq heq laa leh huq aleq, yôôych kajưk dik aduq ka tavek thưq vaarq heq be jah axek hloq. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Vii tuôôy đnooy toah manih karôp, Kơy Plêêk xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Dayh 'yo nee, kaluh hngơy nưq đong truh, Lôôk xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">yôôch gô hnoq dơơp payôôch muuyq tavek đơơu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">dii hnhư I-sơ-ra-ên ji dii hnhư Ju-đa;<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />leh gamưh tyauq tavek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">đơu Gô heq lâp dii khơl mo kơy ku oot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">đom hngơy Gô adrơk ti oot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">xôq jarooy oot vlôh klơlh vari Ai Kâp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">vii oot heq leh kưq măn đom tavek ku Gô,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">Gô kung heq ka'lăk oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Lôôk xanoh.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Vii neq laa tavek</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">đơu Gô hnoq lâp dii hnhư I-sơ-ra-ên</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">atêq kaluh hngơy nưq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Lôôk xanoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">tuôôy xôq kaluh ganuun ku Gô muut xuum biit oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Gô kung hnoq valơk ganuun tok xuum klaak oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ji Gô hnoq laa Kơy Plêêk đôôyq dii oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">ji oot hnoq laa muuyq tamooy deng ka Gô.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kajưk dik oot hnoq be pato tong dro palơy pla oot</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">kung tôôy muuyq oh ay oot, đaneq: ‘Dayh nhonq xet Lôôk,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">vii dêq hloay oot hnoq xet Gô,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">xing dro de dik đom oot dong truh dro kôt dik.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Vii Gô hnoq hwêêt xuum đôôyq dii kaluh varơuq xơk tauq ku oot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">ji Gô kajưk dik hnoq leh măn văch truh kadrôôp maroh ku oot đnoyq.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Vii varơuq xanoh laa “đơơu”, yôôych Kadraq heq khienq ka tavek thưq nhưk jêêk vlôh paq xung liq, đơu varơuq biq khienq ka paq xung liq ji jêêk vlôh duut dek yôôych jeq đaji laa thưq heq hruh hlơơp.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Anưq yôôych, tavek thưq nhưk nưq 'miêh e kaluh ganuun truh varơuq kacheeu ayuôôt, xatyauq muuyq aduq vah 'laarq vari, <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Vii muuyq raap đơ heq jah panưk tok, phon thưq nhưk, đom nưq e kaah jôôk đeen hloay para, kung kaluh poop tôôp tơơk tưp, laa aduq jah taayh laa “Aduq Vah”, <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />măn pi atêq bơk maang thưq vaarq laa phon raap đơ, aduq jah taayh laa “Aduq Vah Dik”, <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />e muuyq para hơu vuh kahlơu bơơn vajang, ji trăp tavek jah kanoop kahlôôp dêq hloay bơơn vajang, pi'lăp nưq laa muuyq wo bơơn vajang tađnưk ma-na, gay katôôlh vlôh raak ku A-rôn, ji kaluh tômq tavek, <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />măn pi taalh trăp, kaluh Chê-ru-bim tađnah tađnaak đơ klum kanôp thi ân, đơu truh kaluh tuôông nưq yôôych leh aalq tuôôy xôq đnooy vlôh dong hlolh dêq. <verse eid="HEB 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Yôôch tuôôy kaluh tuôông nưq heq jah ralauq xôq đanưq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp ragơy hooy muut đom phon raap đơ thưq nhưk, dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq dơơp hơu varơuq ku oot; <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />bơh vơ thơy tơơk tưp kôt muut đom phon thưq vaarq muuyq yưk đom xanưm, ji leh ik leh e vahaap, laa ôq lêh đơu kơy tơơk tưp tok thay ka kadih xăk kung đaji kaluh lôp kadrôôp ku manih karôp. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Lôôk Phool Hiel gamưh varơuq nưq ăm hloq ro đaneq trôôk muut kaluh aduq vah măn koq jah kahnoq vlôh, tuôôy raap đơ thưq nhưk măn e aduq dưk, <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />đơu nưq laa muuyq pheep long lơuq deng ka đơơy xanưm juneq, đơu tyauq kach nưq, kaah kuah lêh hloay ôq lêh jah tơơk tưp tok leh e paraat xôq dơơp xaleep manih ayuôôt laat truh phon xuum klaak, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />vơ tajinq truh tuôông xa ji tuôông hôôch, kung kaluh lêh paxa rêh đêh raa, 'ngưq laa kaluh ganuun truh xăk xamơk, jah xok dơơp dong truh kawat 'meq đơơu hlê.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Bơh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, tuôôy rama vlôh đom varơuq dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt lơyq ku kaluh varơuq kaxay tamaq 'miêh heq e, gamưh hlê hnhư hơu đơ kôt galơh iaq ji xaleep iaq leh aalq ti koot manih panưk tok, 'ngưq laa leh thuôk xuq dêh araak panưk jêêk neq, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaluh rahlăp kadrơy đok: </char><char style="fqa">Lôôk Wơơt Dêh truh xôq dơơp thơy tơơk tưp kôt kua kaluh varơuq tolh kaxay atêq neq.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />kung be aalq bơyh vahaap ku vove pôô ji bo koot, bơh bơyh vahaap ku kadih xăk, Kadraq heq muut đom kaluh aduq vah muuyq yưk đu hloay, kadih kadraq axek jah varơuq wơơt xok đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Vii atoh vahaap vove pôô ji bo pôô kung varơuq paraay vlo bo pi chwoay tol khơl manih heq biq klơơr 'yêq măn jarooy truh varơuq tađôôy đơơu, dơơp đom varơuq paxa rêh xăk xamơk oot, <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />yôôych vahaap ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa Kơy xing Kơy Phool Hiel đơơy đơơy heq tưp kadih xăk dơơp kuah lêh leh hlêêl leh tachoot ka Kơy Plêêk, hnoq kơn paxa rêh xuum klaak ku oh ay xet dong leq klơlh kaluh varơuq dơơp kaxêêt xôq hơu varơuq Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp đok “ku haay” tađôôy vii “ku oh ay”.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Vii kơq nưq, Kadraq laa Kơy Kaplah ku tavek đơơu, xôq ka atêq tuôôy varơuq kaxêêt deng ka varơuq bla xok kaluh lôp kadrôôp gamưh tol tavek thưq nhưk jah kahnoq vlôh, khơl dro heq jah taayh hnoq ik nhonq xok apok tavek truh kơ ngiip đơơy đơơy. <verse eid="HEB 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Vii măn 'leq e ji chuk, măn đnư băt dăt varơuq kaxêêt ku manih dơơp ji chuk pheq jah 'yo xanưk. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Vii ji chuk vơ e ik duh gamưh muut varơuq kaxêêt, vii anưq ni be hmưq 'leq e ik duh tuôôy manih valơk ji chuk măn riirh. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Jo nưq, hloay kaah tavek adroyq dik kung heq leh jah paxa rôp dơơp đơu leh e vahaap. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Vii tuôôy tong ganeen tyauq ganuun heq jah Môi-se đnooy vlôh ka manih karôp, atêq tuôôy xok vahaap bo koot ji vove pôô, kung dii daak, talơy nhơu dôôp, ji đook baai hương, kơy heq ta'nhơyh hloay tol kaah qwuônq rahlăp kung dêq hloay manih karôp, <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />đnooy đaneq: “Neq laa vahaap tavek đơu Kơy Plêêk heq pato dayq ka oh ay.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Yôôch tyauq kach dang đanưq, kơy heq ta'nhơyh vahaap tol hnhư hơu đơ ji tôôy valong đôô đom varơuq đơơp tơơk lêh. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />'Yo tyauq ganuun, đa sôôq tôôy varơuq jah paxa rêh bơơn vahaap, ji leh e varơuq ahngok vahaap yôôych be e varơuq tha ka'lăk.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Vii anưq, muuyq panưh, varơuq duh dik nưq laa kaluh thưq dơơp tyauq kaluh valong tol plêêk jah paxa rêh xing kaluh ôq lêh neq, bơh panưh kadrơy, jơq kaluh valong tol plêêk pheq jah paxa rêh bơơn kaluh ôq lêh tolh iaq dalơh iaq kaluh ôq lêh nưq, <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Vii dik, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq leh muut đom kaluh aduq vah jo ti koot manih dơơp vlôh — laa kaluh thưq dơơp tyauq ku kaluh paroh dong dik — wih hlê laa muut đom jơq daak plêêk, xôq juneq kahnoq adroyq kangưưr ku Kơy Plêêk thay ka haay, <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />kung leh aalq xôq tơơk tưp kadih xăk 'ngưng yưk, dang đaji thơy tơơk tưp kôt tôôy xanưm hooy muut đom kaluh aduq vah kung dii vahaap thuôk xuq khơl kadrơy; <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />vii atoh leh aalq anưq, yôôych varơuq duh dik ka Kadraq laa pheq chiuq pơơl 'ngưng yưk xing tuôôy panưk jêêk dêh araak. Bơh juneq, vơ muuyq yưk muut atêq lôôch kaluh đơơy xanưm, vii kơq varơuq păk kaxêêt kadrôôp maroh, Kadraq heq jah kahnoq vlôh gamưh varơuq chiuq kaxêêt ku Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Ji tyauq đaji varơuq jah đinq 'miêh ka koot manih pheq kaxêêt muuyq yưk, yôôch atêq nưq laa varơuq xưh xadrah, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />yôôych kung anưq, atêq tuôôy jah tơơk tưp vơ muuyq yưk xôq pơq xok kadrôôp maroh 'ngưng manih, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq jah 'yo hloq muut yưk thưq vaarq, leh xôq pơq kadrôôp, bơh xôq varơuq wơơt xok truh dii khơl leq dik xuum takôô Kadraq.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Vii ganuun — tuôôy vơ e long lơuq ku kaluh varơuq tamaq kaxay jeq truh, leh aalq kadih long lơuq ku kaluh varơuq nưq — leh hmưq e 'leq hnoq ik dơơp xaleep khơl leq truh jeq Kơy Plêêk dii kung kaluh ôq lêh đơu oot kưq tuôôt dơơp xagook tơơk tưp tôôy xanưm. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Vii atoh hnoq ik, yôôych be aalq kaluh ôq lêh dik laa heq padơy jah tơơk tưp tok, vii khơl manih ayuôôt laat leh măn pơq xuum klaak kadrôôp maroh đnoyq, tuôôy heq jah 'nhaau xarêh muuyq yưk đu hloay be aalq? <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Wih hlê, dii kaluh ôq lêh nưq, e muuyq varơuq hmưk nhăk truh kadrôôp maroh tôôy xanưm. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Vii vahaap ku bo pôô ji vove pôô leh ik ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh hlơơp ik. <verse eid="HEB 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Jo nưq, tuôôy muut đom dêh araak, Kadraq xanoh:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“Lôôk leh trôôch ôq lêh ji kuah lêh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">bơh Kadraq heq ralauq 'miêh muuyq xăk xamơk ka Koot;<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Kadraq kung be ưng trôôch</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">kaluh kuah lêh vuh ji wơơt kadrôôp.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Atêq nưq, gô tơơl: ‘Xiin 'yo neq, koot truh —</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">tyauq đaji apok đom phon qwuônq rahlăp heq valơk truh koot —</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">xôq dưk dơơp xuum trôôch ku Kadraq, kuh Kơy Plêêk.’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Tuôôy Kadraq xanoh đaji heq đnooy đaneq: “Lôôk leh trôôch ôq lêh ji kuah lêh, kung kaluh kuah lêh vuh ji wơơt kadrôôp. Kadraq kung be ưng trôôch kaluh thưq nưq” (đơu kaluh nưq jah tơơk tưp tok tyauq ganuun), <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />atêq nưq, Kadraq xanoh: “Xiin 'yo nee, Koot truh xôq dưk dơơp iq trôôch ku Kadraq.” Kadraq deep ka'lăk varơuq thưq yưk xôq dơơp avlôh varơuq thưq vaarq. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Vii iq trôôch nưq, haay neq heq jah tađôôy đơơu gamưh varơuq tơơk tưp xăk xamơk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu dơơp ôq lêh muuyq yưk đu hloay. <verse eid="HEB 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Dik, tôôy muuyq thơy tơơk tưp tôôy hngơy dưk dơơp hơu varơuq ji ragơy tưp kung kaluh ôq lêh, đơu kaluh nưq leh hmưq e 'leq hnoq ik xagook ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh hlơơp ik. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Bơh Kadraq, atêq tuôôy vii kơq kadrôôp maroh tưp ôq lêh muuyq heq dong truh miet miet, yôôch heq 'ngôôy aduq pi akoh Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />takôô xing katuôôy nưq dong truh tuôôy khơl adro tachơơl Kadraq biq xôq pôôt dơơp aduq đơ ka jôôk Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Vii gamưh vơ muuyq ôq lêh, Kadraq heq khienq khơl manih jah tađôôy đơơu jêêk vlôh xaleep dong truh miet miet. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Măn Lôôk Phool Hiel kung dơơp xanưk ka haay, vii atêq nưq heq xanoh:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Neq laa tavek đơu Gô hnoq lâp dii oot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">atêq kaluh hngơy nưq, Lôôk xanoh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">tuôôy xôq ganuun Gô đom xuum klaak oot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">Gô kung hnoq valơk ganuun tol akoq biit oot.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Ji:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">“Gô kajưk dik hnoq leh măn văch truh kadrôôp maroh oot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">ji kaluh varơuq xơk tauq ku oot đnoyq.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Bơh aduq leq e varơuq tha ka'lăk kaluh lôp kadrôôp nưq, aduq nưq paq măn ôq lêh bla kadrôôp.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay, vii e jah xuum kôk kalh ka varơuq tawaak muut kaluh aduq vah gamưh vahaap ku Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />laa Kơy heq luh vlôh ka haay muuyq trôôk hooy đơơu ji riirh hlulh hlê bơk maang, 'ngưq laa xăk xamơk Kadraq, <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />ji muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt xakaq 'yo tol hnhư ku Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />vii anưq haay duh truh jeq Kơy Plêêk dii xuum klaak dong dik đom varơuq hôôk kajưk ku xuum tuôq, xuum jah ta'nhơyh vahaap paxa rêh klơlh xuum klaak xơk tauq ji xăk xamơk jah 'nhaau bơơn daak hlăng xarêh. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Haay duh jư kajưk apok đnooy avlôh truh xuum takôô gamưh ku haay leh varaal hwaal, vii Kơy heq tavek laa jư apok. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Ji haay duh biit tabông truh mamuuyq xôq wih truh varơuq ahluk ahlul xuum xung xiaq ji kaluh varơuq tamaq kaxay, <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />tuôôy leh ka'lăk varơuq nhomq hlê kung mamuuyq ku kadih haay đaji katik đôôyq dii muuyq sôôq dro, wih hlê laa ahmưk nhăk mamuuyq, ji atoh oh ay hloq hngơy nưq truh jeq taleq yôôych kơn dơơp anưq 'ngưng iaq tanư.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Vii atoh haay kưq ưng dơơp lôp kadrôôp atêq tuôôy heq nhonq xok varơuq hlolh xet đu truh varơuq dik, yôôych leh măn ôq lêh wơơt kadrôôp đnoyq, <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />bơh laa varơuq takôô ramêq dik kajưk dik truh varơuq xưh xadrah ji truh ôôlh rahưk ralauq xôq vuh jaq khơl adro tachơơl hlê. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Paq kê kơyq, atoh heq ka'lăk vlôh ganuun Môi-se gamưh tol vaarq long pe adro dơơp xanưk, yôôych kaxêêt hlơơp leh angơuq. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Oh ay biit adro joaq jek Koot Kơy Plêêk, ji 'yo vahaap tavek laa leh ra kajoq klơơr 'yêq — đơu vii vahaap nưq, haay jah tađôôy đơu — ji đnooy ra ơơh Kơy Phool Hiel ku vanong plêêk, ni hnoq đangq biq hmơt dook parêq iaq 'ngưng xet taleq? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Vii haay xet Kơy heq xanoh: “Varơuq bla dook laa ku Gô; Gô hnoq bla dook.” Ji laay đaneq: “Lôôk hnoq xưh xadrah tamooy Kadraq.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Klêh muut ti Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh laa muuyq varơuq ramêq dik!<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Bơh dayh văch hlê kaluh hngơy adroyq neq, đơu heq jah luh laak đom kaluh hngơy nưq, đaneq oh ay heq chiuq muuyq đơơt tahmơt kôt lơyq ku 'ngưng varơuq jiq jiêh, <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />tuôôy nưq yôôych chiuq kaah varơuq đnooy ra ơơh hloay rôp toop kangưưr manih karôp, măn tuôôy hơq yôôych jah jêêk vlôh manih ahlook aklah dii khơl leq biq dơơp tyauq kach nưq. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Vii oh ay kung heq biit angơuq khơl manih biq karuk, ji heq đoonq nhonq katuôôy hmơt varoh garuh anôôp oh ay dii varơuq hlah hlaak, vii xet kadih oh ay e garuh anôôp tolh kaxay iaq ji măn miet. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">Vii oh ay e xuum biit angơuq đôôyq dii gô đom tuôôy măn kong looy tooy.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Jo anưq, oh ay te liq avih ka'lăk xuum tuôq kajưk ku oh ay, laa varơuq e muuyq phon kadrool thier kôt. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Vii oh ay e varơuq duh truh katik atuq xuum chiuq uunq, xôq atêq tuôôy dưk dơơp iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, oh ay hnoq ik nhonq jah apok tavek.<verse eid="HEB 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />“Vii đom măn leh xiik đnoyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">Kơy đong truh hnoq truh, ji hnoq leh manưưn manưl.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Bơh manih hyioh jăk ku Gô hnoq riirh bơyh xuum tuôq;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">măn atoh xăk xadăk luuy, yôôych phool hiel Gô be hlah xuum truh xăk.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Bơh kadih xăk haay leh măn đom varơuq xadăk luuy truh aduq kaxêêt hlơơp, wih hlê laa đom xuum tuôq wih truh aduq xôq wơơt ku phool hiel.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Xuum tuôq laa varơuq kajưk dik truh kaluh varơuq jah takôô gamưh, laa bơơn xanưk truh kaluh varơuq be hloq ik. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Vii bơyh xuum tuôq, khơl manih hnu heq jah xanưk kaxay. <verse eid="HEB 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Bơyh xuum tuôq haay nhonq xet plêêk vari neq heq jah dơơp payôôch bơyh apok xanoh ku Kơy Plêêk — xôq varơuq hloq ik heq leh jêêk yuôôr xing varơuq hnoq ik 'yo hloq. <verse eid="HEB 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Vii xuum tuôq A-bên heq tơơk tưp tok Kơy Plêêk muuyq kuah lêh tolh iaq so dii Ka-in, đơu gamưh đnư kơy jah 'yo nhonq laa hyioh jăk, tuôôy Kơy Plêêk avlôh varơuq 'yo nhonq tol kaluh kuah lêh ku kơy, ji gamưh xuum tuôq, A-bên đong măn đnooy long heq kaxêêt. <verse eid="HEB 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Vii xuum tuôq Hê-nok jah taway hooy, be hmưq jah xet varơuq kaxêêt, ji “kơy leh jah axek hloq, jo Kơy Plêêk heq taway kơy hooy.” Vii adroyq ka varơuq taway hooy ku kơy, kơy heq jah 'yo nhonq laa dơơp hlah xuum Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Anưq bơh, leh e xuum tuôq yôôych leh ik dơơp hlah xuum Kơy Plêêk, vii varơuq băt dăt đôôyq dii dro truh kung Kơy Plêêk laa pheq tuôq đaneq Kadraq hloay e ji Kadraq laa Kơy kahniq kadrool ka khơl leq axek akhiim Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, atêq tuôôy jah đnooy adroyq truh kaluh varơuq koq jah hloq, yôôych vii kuh yôq, Nô-ê heq đongq muuyq poop tau deng ka varơuq wơơt waak ku kôôch hnhư kơy, đơu hlê đnư, kơy heq tok xadrah dêh araak ji jêêk vlôh dro dưk katôôl varơuq hyioh jăk gamưh tol xuum tuôq. <verse eid="HEB 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, vii jah tawooyh taayh, Ap-ra-ham heq tameng apok xôq vlôh hooy truh aduq đơu kơy hnoq nhonq dơơp kơ ngiip, ji kơy heq vlôh hooy tuôôy leh xet kơy đong hooy maleq. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, kơy măn hlê đom vari tavek đaji tamooy kadrơy, tuôôy heq riirh đom pơ raap dii I-sak ji Ja-kôp, khơl manih achung dưk katôôl ku kung muuyq apok tavek, <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Vii kơy măn takôô muuyq theng e kahnier, đơu Kienq Truk Sư ji Manih Xơy Tok ku theng nưq laa Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, pheq đnooy kadih Sa-ra heq nhonq jah paraat xôq măn bonq hloay kaah tuôôy heq qwaq kawat 'yo tamuut ku tuuyh, vii mo 'yo nhonq Kơy heq tavek laa jư apok.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">E varơuq koq lưp jah kajưk ji apok neq đnooy truh xuum tuôq kua Ap-ra-ham long ku Sa-ra. </char><char style="fqa">Gamưh xuum tuôq, Ap-ra-ham măn e paraat pa iir koot, long ăm kadih Sa-ra thoon. Varơuq xalih vlôh tabơh long kơy xanưm heq karaq, vii kơy 'yo Plêêk heq kahniq apok tavek ji jư apok.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Vii anưq, kung xing aduq muuyq dro — ji ju biq 'yo đaji kaxêêt yôôch — kaluh đơơy koot xau heq jah pa iir vlôh, đaji kasôôq 'ngưng karôp đaji kaluh xalok tol plêêk, ji đaji choah leh hnoq jauq ik pi gah tahli. <verse eid="HEB 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Đom xuum tuôq, dêq hloay khơl manih neq heq kaxêêt tuôôy koq nhonq jah kaluh apok tavek, bơh 'yo hloq ji hrok kôô ni xing xangưưy, kung xưng đaneq oot laa tamooy kadrơy ji tamooy charôô dêh tol vari. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Vii khơl manih đnooy kaluh varơuq đanưq ăm hloq ro đaneq oot đong axek akhiim muuyq dêh katu. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Atoh oot văch truh dêh katu đơu oot heq xing đnư vlôh hooy, yôôych kajưk dik laa oot heq e kawah xôq wiit xuq. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Bơh juneq oot thier trôôch muuyq aduq tolh kaxay iaq, nưq laa dêh katu tol plêêk. Jo nưq Kơy Plêêk leh kamưưl truh oot, xôq jah xưng laa Kơy Plêêk ku oot, vii Kadraq heq ralauq xôq muuyq theng ka oot. <verse eid="HEB 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Vii xuum tuôq, Ap-ra-ham tơơk tưp I-sak tuôôy chiuq thư, pheq đnooy atêq tuôôy nhonq jah kaluh apok tavek, kơy heq taway tơơk tưp koot kanau vơ muuyq ku kơy, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />đơu truh koot nưq, e apok xanoh đaneq: “Gamưh I-sak, adrơơk ku koot hnoq jah taayh anơng,” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />vii heq biit kajưk đaneq Kơy Plêêk e qwuyen dơơp ăm riirh hlê, kê kaah xing aduq kaxêêt, ji đom iq bongq, kơy heq nhonq hlê koot kơy xing aduq nưq. <verse eid="HEB 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kung bơyh xuum tuôq, I-sak apôôy vanong ka Ja-kôp ji Ê-sau truh kaluh varơuq hnoq xalih truh. <verse eid="HEB 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, tuôôy jeq kaxêêt, Ja-kôp chuk vanong ka tong koot kanau ku Jô-sep, ji ganưq muut akoq gay katôôlh kơy, kơy kul takuul ayuôôt laat. <verse eid="HEB 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, tuôôy truh lôôch đơơy, Jô-sep panhăk văch truh varơuq vlôh hooy ku koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên ji đnooy dăt oot truh khiêk ku kơy. <verse eid="HEB 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, atêq tuôôy jah pa iir vlôh, Môi-se heq jah miq vaq kơy xagook padu đom pe xiêk vii oot hloq oh de kaxay tamaq, ji oot leh yôq apok tanưưl ku vuua. <verse eid="HEB 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, tuôôy heq kôt, Môi-se chôôyq ka'lăk jah taayh laa koot kanau ku koot kadrê Pha-ra-ôn. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Tađôôy muut đnư, kơy rơơlh chiuq pơơl kung dii koot xau Lôôk iaq laa jah xa hôôch taamq bơq ku kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Kơy 'yo hloq varơuq đnooy ra ơơh ku manih jah para jơu laa varơuq karoh e kôt galơh iaq kaluh garuh anôôp ku Ai Kâp, vii kơy 'yo kach ranih muut wih truh phon kadrool ku kơy. <verse eid="HEB 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, kơy vlôh klơlh Ai Kâp, leh yôq đơơt jaraq ku vuua, vii kơy kajưk xuum chiuq uunq dang đaji đong 'yo hloq Kơy leh hloq ik. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, kơy jư Lêh Dalơh Hlê ji varơuq ta'nhơyh vahaap, xôq kơy păk kaxêêt dêq khơl koot ay kaa leh đuk truh manih karôp. <verse eid="HEB 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, manih karôp hooy tapa hlê Tahli Dôôp dang đaji dalơh hlê vari kateh, laa aduq đơu manih Ai Kâp heq biq luôôt apoop atêq tuôôy vlôh dêq paraat dơơp. <verse eid="HEB 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, kaluh apưt theng Jê-ri-kô hrưp pôôt, atêq tuôôy biq hooy rawiit tuôôt pơh hngơy. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Bơyh xuum tuôq, mư xakwoah Ra-hap leh kaxêêt achung kung khơl adro leh tuôq, atêq tuôôy tiip đoonq khơl dro hooy xoak dii xuum hlah hlaak. <verse eid="HEB 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Ji Gô hnoq ik đnooy athêêp varơuq kajoq đnoyq? Vii kawat hnoq leh đu ka gô tuôôy taboon hlê truh Gê-đê-ôn, Ba-rak, Sam-sôn, Jep-thê, Đa-vik, ji kaah Sa-mu-ên hloay khơl hnhư hlit, <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />laa khơl manih, gamưh xuum tuôq, heq jah jay kaluh daak, dưk dơơp hyioh jăk, nhonq jah apok tavek, biik huuy ôô vomq, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />kajôp poch paraat kalh ku ôôlh, xaloot klơlh pla xieh, jah kalh paraat xing aduq ravoch, jah yuôôr kalh paraat đom tahmơt jăk, khienq ka kaluh bing kuun daak kadrơy pheq tameng tyauq. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />'Ngưng khơl kadrê nhonq hlê manih hnhư heq kaxêêt ku oot xing varơuq riirh hlê, bơh khơl manih kadrơy biq hmơt tiel, leh biit takôô varơuq luh tha, xôq oot hnoq ik jah nhonq varơuq riirh hlê tolh kaxay iaq; <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />măn sôôq kadrơy đnoyq heq chiuq thưh thek xing kaluh apok đnooy ra ơơh ji tu tiel, đơu iaq anưq đnoyq laa kal vek ji karuk tu. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Oot biq tiip phơu, biq akưa vaarq, oot chiuq thưh thek, kaxêêt bơyh pla xieh păk kaxêêt, oot hooy kađneng kahơ đom kađuh trưưu, kađuh vove, biq pangoot adrah, biq rôp toop, biq xa dơơp ra ơơh;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Muuyq sôôq rahlăp hnu iaq đok: </char><char style="fqa">Oot biq tiip phơu. Oot biq akưa vaarq. Oot biq păk kaxêêt bơơn xieh.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />(đơu dêh araak yôôych be taxưngq dii oot), biq jarooy hooy hyaak hyul đom wăngq we, đoot gôk, kaluh kôôp troop ji hôôm raluk 'laarq vari. <verse eid="HEB 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Ji atêq tuôôy jah xanưk kaxay vii kơq xuum tuôq, dêq hloay khơl manih neq koq nhonq hlê apok tavek ka oot, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />vii Kơy Plêêk heq ralauq 'miêh varơuq tolh iaq tajinq truh haay, xôq ka leh e haay, oot leh jah dơơp ăm xaleep.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Vii anưq lunưq, đong tuôôy e muuyq đum kluk thier kôt ku 'ngưng khơl xanưk dưk rawiit haay, yôôych haay, atêq tuôôy taweek ka'lăk tôôy pơq parêq ji kadrôôp maroh klêq dơơp klơl hlê, kung duh pheq charơơk tathi jah xôq kangưưr haay dii varơuq atuq xuum, <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />'yo anhinq muut Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy Panưk Jêêk ji Kơy Dơơp Payôôch ku xuum tuôq, laa Kơy vii xuum hlah xôq kangưưr kadraq heq pơq chiuq gay charăk, 'yo leh ra kajoq varơuq đnooy ra ơơh, juneq Kadraq heq 'ngôôy aduq pi akoh ngaai Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Dayh atrêêk 'yo dong wêêt Kơy heq pơq chiuq varơuq tachơơl dang anưq bơyh khơl adro kadrôôp maroh wih truh oot, xôq oh ay leh galeh galal đom xuum oh ay, jarooy truh gưlh xuum.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Oh ay heq koq tangưưr hlê truh mưk kahrôq vahaap tuôôy tahmơt tachơơl hlê kadrôôp maroh, <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />đơu oh ay heq padêq hloay tawol hlơơp varơuq ahmưk nhăk, laa apok pato dăt oh ay đaji koot, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“Koot ku gô lơơy, te 'yo ahyơơl varơuq pato dayq ku Lôôk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">kung te gưlh xuum tuôôy biq Kadraq toah;<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Vii dro Lôôk xiaq, yôôych Kadraq 'meq dook,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">ji Kadraq tiel dook tôôy dro koot đơu Kadraq tiip nhonq.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Oh ay đong chiuq uunq đom varơuq pato dook; 'ngưq laa Kơy Plêêk đong xa dơơp dii oh ay đaji koot. Vii dro koot leq đơu vaq leh 'meq dook? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Bơh atoh oh ay leh pheq chiuq varơuq 'meq dook, laa varơuq đơu dêq hloay koot xau heq jêêk vlôh khơl dro kung chiuq, anưq yôôych oh ay laa taleq dro koot hyaak, đơu be aalq laa khơl adro koot dik. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Iaq đnoyq, haay e khơl vaq phon xăk ku haay, đaji khơl manih pato dook, ji haay măn 'yo vado; măn đôôyq dii Vaq phon danưng kooy, be aalq haay hnoq tameng tyauq kơn 'ngưng iaq, ji haay hnoq riirh be aalq? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Vii ju vaq phon xăk pato dook haay đom axit hngơy tyauq varơuq 'yo đaji laa tolh dik đôôyq dii oot, bơh Vaq phon danưng kooy pato dook vii kơq taway ich lơơy ka haay, xôq jưq phon muut varơuq vah xarêh ku Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Tyauq tôôy varơuq pato dook đom tuôôy xalih vlôh be e veeh kajoq laa xuum hlah, wih hlê laa jiq jiêh, bơh kơn atêq, varơuq nưq vlôh raak play hrok hrol ku varơuq hyioh jăk ka khơl leq heq jah varơuq atuq xing ni. <verse eid="HEB 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Vii anưq, dayh dơơp kalh paraat hlê kaluh pla ti biq galeh galal ji kaluh takuul biq ruh rooy, <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />ji dayh dơơp pahyioh kaluh trôôk hooy ka jôôk oh ay, xôq dro qwe hnoq ik leh biq hyaak trôôk, đơu tađôôy muut đnư laa jah payơh.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Dayh charơơk tyauq varơuq tagu dii tôôy dro, kung varơuq yuôôr vah, đơu leh e varơuq neq yôôych be kơyq hnoq jah 'yo hloq Lôôk, <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />bơơn kach rơơt rol jư 'yo, tebe kơyq nưq tavlaayh klơlh vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, leh kheoq rayah pahlăk leq nưq vlok tok dơơp măk meel, ji 'ngưng adro hnoq ik biq klơơr 'yêq vii ni, <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />tebe akơyq nưq apuq atrăp long paq duh đaji Ê-sau, laa adro vii tađôôy xok muuyq tuôông xa heq tek qwuyen ay kaa ku ni. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Vii oh ay xet đaneq pheq đnooy atêq nưq, tuôôy ưng trôôch jah vanong kaxay, yôôych kơy heq biq khelh vlôh, jo kơy be axek jah kawah wiit xuum, long ju axek akhiim ni achung dii daak mot.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Vii oh ay heq leh truh jeq dii varơuq hnoq ik vêq muut ik, dii ôôlh jaq rahưk, dii klôôy kamơng, dii varơuq kamơng jaluk, ji dii khiel xong xôôy <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />kung dii hnưm ahna ku keeng, ji dii hnưm ahlôôk ku kaluh apok đơu khơl manih tameng heq apôôy vôôch xôq oot leh pheq nhonq athêêp muuyq apok leq đnoyq. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Vii oot be chiuq nôôy tanưưl jah đnooy, đaneq: “Atoh koot ôô leq pheq đnooy vơ đuk muut đoot, ni hnoq biq tiip phơu.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ji varơuq 'yo jah kahnoq vlôh yôôych thier ramêq pheq đnooy Môi-se heq đnooy: “Gô varaal hwaal ji vadrau vadrik.” <verse eid="HEB 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Lunư, oh ay heq truh dii Đoot Si-ôn ji theng ku Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, dii Jê-ru-sa-lem tol plêêk, dii karavơu yaak plêêk, dii tayuup anguk kôt, <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />dii tayuup vah ku khơl koot ay kaa heq jah valơk anơng tol kaluh tal plêêk, dii Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy Xưh Xadrah ku tôôy dro, dii kaluh yaak ku khơl manih hyioh jăk heq jah dơơp ăm xaleep, <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />dii Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy Kaplah ku tavek đơơu, ji dii vahaap ku varơuq ahngok vlôh e apok đnooy kalh paraat iaq so dii A-bên. <verse eid="HEB 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Dayh 'yo rơơt, tebe oh ay chôôyq ka'lăk Kơy đong xanoh pato. Vii atoh khơl adro hơq heq leh xaloot ik atêq tuôôy chôôyq ka'lăk manih đnooy panhăk oot măn 'laarq vari, yôôych haay kơn têq iaq đnoyq, tuôôy laa khơl adro wih katoor dii Kơy vlôh xing plêêk, <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />đơu apok ku Kơy nưq heq dơơp vari anhưh ahrưng muut kawat nưq, măn juneq Kadraq heq tavek đaneq: “Muuyq yưk tra kadih Gô hnoq dơơp anhưh ahrưng, leh vơ vari, đơu laa hloay plêêk.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Bơh kaluh apok “Muuyq yưk tra” đong pato ro varơuq deep ka'lăk kaluh thưq biq ahrưng anhưh, đaji kaluh vâk heq jah panưk jêêk, xôq ka kaluh varơuq leh biq ahrưng anhưh hnoq ik măn hlê. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Jo nưq, haay duh e xuum xet ơơn tuôôy nhonq xok muuyq daak dêh leh ahrưng anhưh, đơu hlê đnư haay hnoq ik ayuôôt laat tyauq kach kaxay xuum Kơy Plêêk, dii varơuq kul vado hloay kul yôq, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />Vii Kơy Plêêk ku haay laa gooy ôôlh huur vuh.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Xuum xung xiaq oh ay pheq kưq măn miet. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Te ka'lăk tawol xuum xung tamooy, vii bơyh varơuq neq, muuyq sôôq dro heq leh xet ju tiip đoonq khơl yaak plêêk. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Dayh văch truh khơl dro biq karuk tu, đaji heq biq kal achung dii oot, ji khơl adro biq xa dơơp ra ơơh, đaji kadih oh ay kung đong măn đom muuyq xăk xamơk. <verse eid="HEB 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Đaamq pajêêk pheq laa varơuq vado dik đom katul tôôy dro, ji chanưng pajêêk yôôych pheq leh klơơr 'yêq, vii Kơy Plêêk hnoq xưh xadrah khơl adro apuq atrăp ji bing tuut taak. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Trôôk riirh oh ay yôôych pheq leh hmưch jêêt, tuôôy hlah xuum dii kaluh varơuq đong e, vii kadih Kadraq heq xanoh: “Gô hnoq leh hmưq e 'leq chuh xangưưy koot, Gô kung hnoq leh hmưq e 'leq ka'lăk tăk koot,” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />dong pheq đnooy, vii jah xuum kôk kalh, haay đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Lôôk laa Kơy Waak gô ji gô hnoq be yôq varaal.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Khơl kadrơy hnoq dơơp kajoq gô?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Dayh văch truh khơl manih jarooy pato haay, laa khơl manih padoh apok ku Kơy Plêêk ka oh ay, tuôôy tabông 'yo raak play đơơy riirh ku oot, dayh dơơp tyauq xuum tuôq ku oot. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu hngơy ahnưh, hngơy neng ji dong truh đơơy đơơy yôôych măn i ja. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Te biq adô aluut xing đu thưq pato dayq đêh xateek. Vii varơuq kaxay tamaq ka xuum klaak laa jah jư 'yo xing vanong plêêk, be aalq xing kaluh tuôông xa, đơu dii kaluh thưq nưq, khơl adro riirh bơyh ni be jah ich lơơy kajoq. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Haay e muuyq para hơu, đơu xing neng, khơl manih hơu varơuq đom hnhư hơu đơ leh e qwuyen xa. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Vii vahaap bla kadrôôp, laa phon vlôh xing kaluh poop ôô, jah xagook muut kaluh aduq vah xing thơy tơơk tưp kôt, phon xaak ku ni yôôych biq vuh pi gôk raap kuun. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Jo nưq, Lôôk Jê-xu kung heq chiuq pơơl jiq pi gôk 'mok theng, xôq Kadraq hnoq ik tađôôy đơơu manih karôp gamưh vahaap ku kadih Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Vii anưq, haay duh truh dii Kadraq pi gôk raap kuun, pơq xok varơuq đnooy ra ơơh ku Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Vii haay leh e muuyq theng leq măn miet aduq neq, wih hlê, haay đong axek akhiim muuyq theng jeq truh. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Gamưh Kadraq, haay hnoq ik tơơk tưp kuah lêh kacheeu ayuôôt atok Kơy Plêêk đom tôôy varơuq, nưq laa raak play ku huuy vel xưng nhonq yal Kadraq. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Măn varơuq dơơp varơuq kaxay ji varơuq ahlook aklah waak rơy yôôych te ka'lăk tawol vii Kơy Plêêk jah hlah xuum truh kaluh ôq lêh đanưq. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Dayh tameng apok ji tameng tyauq khơl manih jarooy pato oh ay, vii oot parol kôô đôôyq dii phool hiel oh ay đaji hnoq ăm vlôh apok padoh vlôh, xôq ka oot hnoq ik dơơp varơuq nưq dii xuum hlah hlaak đơu be ramooy, vii varơuq neq be ich lơơy ka oh ay.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Dayh apôôy ka 'wot, vii 'wot jah tameng tyauq đaneq 'wot e xuum klaak kaxay, tuôôy ưng trôôch riirh dong jơq dik đom tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Bơh gô kơn ahmưk nhăk oh ay dơơp đanưq 'ngưng iaq đnoyq, xôq gô meel jah wiit xuq dii oh ay.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Kơy Plêêk hrok hrol, Kơy heq rôôk kah Kơy Xakaq Trưưu Kôt, 'ngưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu haay, xing aduq kaxêêt gamưh vahaap tavek đơơy đơơy, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />apôôy Kadraq ralauq xôq oh ay dii tôôy varơuq tolh kaxay xôq dưk dơơp iq trôôch ku Kadraq, tuôôy dơơp varơuq kaxay xuum kangưưr Kadraq đom haay, gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa Kơy đơu tađnah tađnaak wih xuq Kadraq dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Wơơy oh ay, gô panhăk oh ay atuq xuum dii varơuq apok ahmưk nhăk neq, vii gô heq valơk ka oh ay vơ hlê taleq apok đơu heq. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Oh ay xet đaneq dro oh ay Ti-mô-thê ku haay heq jah bla rayơh rayơơy, đơu kung nhu nưq gô hnoq tavơh mot oh ay atoh nhu nưq truh meel.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Xiin jah vôôch hlơq dêq hloay khơl manih jarooy pato oh ay kung dêq hloay khơl vah. Khơl vah xing I-ta-li vôôch hlơq oh ay.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Apôôy vanong plêêk măn kung dêq hloay oh ay.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>